      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 433,
      "ruku": 374,
      "hizbQuarter": 173,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3648,
      "text": "So Today none of you has the power to benefit or harm one another. And We will say to the wrongdoers, “Taste the punishment of the Fire which you used to deny!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 34,
        "name": "سُورَةُ سَبَإٍ",
        "englishName": "Saba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Sheba",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 433,
      "ruku": 374,
      "hizbQuarter": 173,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3649,
      "text": "When Our clear verses are recited to them, they say, “This is nothing but a man who wishes to turn you away from what your forefathers used to worship.” And they say, “This is nothing but a fabricated lie.” And the disbelievers say about the Truth when it comes to them, “This is nothing but clear magic,”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 34,
        "name": "سُورَةُ سَبَإٍ",
        "englishName": "Saba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Sheba",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 433,
      "ruku": 374,
      "hizbQuarter": 173,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3650,
      "text": "even though We did not give them any scriptures to study, nor did We send them any warner before you.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 34,
        "name": "سُورَةُ سَبَإٍ",
        "englishName": "Saba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Sheba",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
